\title{Energy after the other vertices are eliminated}
\date{2026-11-06}

\p{\ref{fdip-00DB} computes the resistance between two vertices
of a unit cycle. The two paths between those vertices meet only
at the endpoints. After the remaining vertices are eliminated,
what energy does one of those paths retain, and what energy
does the cycle retain?}
